file tools/ales_reverb_console_predelay_witness.rish the witness proving six laws and re-proving ALES194/ALES192 green beside it
recommend keep-going — the stereo console pre-delay is the thin twin (ALES197); after it the reverb's which/how-much/when are complete mono and stereo, then a damping knob is the next genuinely new primitive. All purely local, no gate.
